{"id":"inogda","lemma":"иногда","pos":"adv","rank":237,"glosses":["sometimes, at times","now and then"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bc/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Иногда это ещё работает.","en":"It still works sometimes.","words":[null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"still / more"},{"g":"to work","l":"работать"}]},{"text":"Ненавижу иногда эту работу.","en":"I hate this job sometimes.","words":[{"g":"to hate","l":"ненавидеть"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Иногда достаточно одного слова.","en":"A word is sometimes enough.","words":[null,{"g":"enough, sufficiently"},null,{"g":"word, term","l":"слово"}]},{"text":"Я иногда об этом думаю.","en":"I think about it sometimes.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"about"},null,{"g":"to think","l":"думать"}]},{"text":"Том иногда такой.","en":"Tom is like that sometimes.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"like that, like this"}]}]}